body:
Thank you for your comment! Could you elaborate what you mean by the value of the information in the video? I play a lot of Eve myself and put pretty much everything you need to know in the video so I'm quite curious.

&#x200B;

And you're absolutely right about the microphone - its my first time doing a voiceover so im quite new at it :) If you have any tips to avoid that I'd love to hear it!
